</head><body><%- include('../partials/site-header') %><div class="page-header"><div class="container"><div class="page-header-box"><h2>Express Delivery</h2><nav><ol class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li><li><a href="service.html">Services</a></li><li>Express Delivery</li></ol></nav></div></div></div>
<main class="service-detail-page"><div class="container"><div class="row service-detail-layout"><aside class="col-lg-4"><div class="service-sidebar"><div class="service-nav-card"><h3>Freight Services</h3><ul><li><a href="ocean-freight.html">Ocean Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="air-freight.html">Air Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="cargo-freight.html">Cargo Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a class="active" href="express-delivery.html">Express Delivery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="customs-clearance.html">Customs Clearance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="project-cargo.html">Project Cargo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="pet-transport.html">Pet Transport <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li></ul></div><div class="service-help-card"><h3>Need a priority delivery?</h3><p>Share the collection address, destination, package details, and delivery deadline.</p><a href="contact.html">Check delivery options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a></div></div></aside>
<div class="col-lg-8"><div class="service-main-image"><img src="/images/service-4.jpg" alt="Express delivery vehicle handling an urgent shipment"></div>
<section class="service-overview"><div class="service-kicker">Priority when it matters</div><h1>Priority delivery, clearly coordinated</h1><p>Our express service supports urgent documents, parcels, parts, and business shipments. Before confirming an option, we check collection availability, the route, package details, and your deadline.</p><p>We coordinate pickup, provide progress updates, and arrange the recipient handoff so you understand each stage of the delivery.</p></section>
<section class="service-features"><h2 class="service-section-title">Express delivery support</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i><h3>Priority handling</h3><p>Focused support for urgent shipments within the confirmed delivery window.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-box"></i><h3>Documents and parcels</h3><p>Delivery options for properly packaged parcels, business materials, and essential supplies.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i><h3>Route coordination</h3><p>Collection and delivery details checked before dispatch to help avoid delays.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell"></i><h3>Status communication</h3><p>Reference numbers and progress updates that keep senders and recipients informed.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-process"><h2 class="service-section-title">From request to delivery</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Request</h3><p>Tell us about the package, route, and delivery deadline.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Confirm</h3><p>We check availability and confirm the service details.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Collect</h3><p>Your shipment is collected for the agreed delivery service.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Deliver</h3><p>The recipient receives the shipment at its destination.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-faqs"><h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about express delivery</h2><div class="accordion" id="expressFaq"><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#expressOne">When can my shipment arrive?</button></h3><div id="expressOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#expressFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Delivery timing depends on when the item is ready, the distance, destination access, shipment type, and service availability. We review these details before confirming a delivery window.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#expressTwo">What details do you need to book?</button></h3><div id="expressTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#expressFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Provide pickup and delivery addresses, contact details, contents, package size and weight, collection readiness, and your delivery deadline.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#expressThree">Which items need approval?</button></h3><div id="expressThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#expressFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. Restrictions vary by route, transport method, and contents. Declare all items before booking so we can review them.</div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="service-cta"><div><h2>Tell us your delivery deadline</h2><p>Send your delivery details and we’ll check the available options.</p></div><a href="/quote?service=express_delivery" class="btn-default">Request Delivery</a></div></div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/site-footer') %><script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script><script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script><script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script><script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script></body></html>
